<Layout title="Professional Voiceover Recording Studio" description="Kitty Kelly’s Valencia voiceover studio, with a SessionBooth, Lewitt LCT 540 S microphone and directed remote sessions via SourceConnect, Cleanfeed and Zoom.">
 <section class="inner-hero"><nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span>The studio</span></nav><p class="eyebrow">MY SPACE. YOUR SESSION.</p><h1>Good sound.<br/><em>Great connection.</em></h1><p class="intro">A dedicated recording studio in Valencia. A London base.<br/>Ready to connect with your team, wherever you’re listening.</p></section>
 <section class="section studio-grid"><img class="studio-photo" src="/media/studio-750.webp" width="750" height="1000" alt="Kitty’s double-wall SessionBooth in Valencia"/><div><p class="eyebrow">BEHIND THE MIC</p><h2>Built for<br/><em>your words.</em></h2><ul class="equipment-list"><li>Recording space<span>SessionBooth double-wall vocal booth</span></li><li>Microphone<span>Lewitt LCT 540 S</span></li><li>Audio interface<span>Focusrite Scarlett Solo, 3rd Gen</span></li><li>Headphones<span>Beyerdynamic DT 770 PRO</span></li></ul><p class="studio-description">Join a directed session through SourceConnect, Cleanfeed, Zoom or SessionLink. For audiobooks, I can record using punch and roll.</p><a class="button dark-button" href="/contact">Talk about your session <Icon name="external" size={18}/></a></div></section>
 <section class="section studio-inperson"><div><p class="eyebrow">LET’S BE IN THE SAME ROOM</p><h2>Sometimes, it’s nice<br/><em>to get out of the booth.</em></h2></div><div><p>I work remotely with clients in the UK, US and Europe, and regularly return to my London base. In-house recordings can be arranged in the UK, Valencia and other Spanish cities, including Madrid and Barcelona.</p><a class="text-link" href="/contact">Discuss an in-person recording <Icon size={18}/></a></div></section>
 <section class="section studio-gallery-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">A LOOK AROUND</p><h2>Welcome to <em>my office.</em></h2></div></div><div class="studio-gallery">{[1,2,3,4,5].map((i)=><img src={'/media/portfolio/studio-'+i+'.webp'} width="750" height="750" loading="lazy" alt={['','Inside Kitty’s recording booth','The recording booth entrance','A corner of Kitty’s Valencia office','The booth in the recording space','Microphone and recording desk inside the booth'][i]}/>)}</div></section>
 <section class="section location-section"><figure><img src="/media/portfolio/studio-7.webp" width="750" height="500" loading="lazy" alt="Valencia city skyline"/><figcaption><h3>Valencia</h3><p>My home studio, connected to the world.</p></figcaption></figure><figure><img src="/media/portfolio/studio-8.webp" width="750" height="500" loading="lazy" alt="Tower Bridge and the London skyline"/><figcaption><h3>London</h3><p>My roots, and a base for in-person sessions.</p></figcaption></figure></section>
</Layout>
